          "number": 7,
          "unit_order": 7,
          "source_marker": "6",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=4&verse=6"
          ],
          "text": "ወኢትትሃበሉ፡ ትግበሩ፡ ዘንተ፡ ወኢትትዐበዩ፡ ወኢትትዐገሉ፡ ቢጸክሙ፡ በኵሉ። እስመ፡ መስተበቅል፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ በእንተ፡ ዝንቱ፡ ኵሉ። በከመ፡ አቅደምኩ፡ ነጊሮተክሙ፡ ወአስማዕኩ፡ ለክሙ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 8,
          "unit_order": 8,
          "source_marker": "7",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=4&verse=7"
          ],
          "text": "እስመ፡ ኢጸውዐነ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ለርኩስ፡ ዘእንበለ፡ ለቅድሳት።"
        },
        {
          "number": 9,
          "unit_order": 9,
          "source_marker": "8",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=4&verse=8"
          ],
          "text": "ወይእዜኒ፡ ዘክሕደሰ፡ ለያእምር፡ ከመ፡ አኮ፡ ለሰብእ፡ ዘይክሕድ። ዘእንበለ፡ ለእግዚአብሔር፡ ዘወሀበክሙ፡ መንፈሰ፡ ቅዱሰ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 10,
          "unit_order": 10,
          "source_marker": "9",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=4&verse=9"
