          ],
          "text": "ወንሕነሰ፡ እንዘ፡ ውሉደ፡ መዓልት፡ ንሕነ። ንንቃሕ፡ ወንልበስ፡ ልብሰ፡ ኀጺን፡ ዘሃይማኖት፡ ወዘተፋቅሮ። ወንትቀጸል፡ ጌራ፡ ተስፋ፡ መድኀኒት።"
        },
        {
          "number": 10,
          "unit_order": 10,
          "source_marker": "9",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=9"
          ],
          "text": "እስመ፡ ኢረሰየነ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ለመንሱት፡ ዘእንበለ፡ ለሕይወት፡ ወለመድኀኒት። በእግዚእነ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ ዘሞተ፡ ለነ፡ ቤዛነ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 11,
          "unit_order": 11,
          "source_marker": "10",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=10"
          ],
          "text": "እመኒ፡ ንቁሓን፡ ንሕነ፡ ወእመኒ፡ ንዉማን፡ ምስሌሁ፡ ነሐዩ፡ ኵልነ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 12,
          "unit_order": 12,
          "source_marker": null,
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [],
          "text": "በእንተ፡ ናዝዞተ፡ ቢጽ"
        },
        {
          "number": 13,
          "unit_order": 13,
          "source_marker": "11",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=11"
          ],
          "text": "ወይእዜኒ፡ አስተፍሥሑ፡ ቢጸክሙ፡ በእንተ፡ ዝ። ወይሕንጽ፡ አሐዱ፡ ካልኦ፡ ዘከመ፡ ትገብሩ፡ ዓዲ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 14,
          "unit_order": 14,
          "source_marker": "12",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=12"
          ],
          "text": "ወናስተበቊዐክሙ፡ አኀዊነ፡ ዑቅዎሙ፡ ለእለ፡ ይጻምዉ፡ በውስቴትክሙ። ወለእለ፡ ይቀውሙ፡ ለክሙ፡ በእንተ፡ እግዚእነ፡ ወይሜህሩክሙ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 15,
          "unit_order": 15,
          "source_marker": "13",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=13"
          ],
          "text": "አክብርዎሙ፡ ፈድፋደ፡ ወአፍቅርዎሙ፡ በእንተ፡ ምግባሮሙ፡ ወተአምኅዎሙ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 16,
          "unit_order": 16,
          "source_marker": "14",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=14"
          ],
          "text": "ወናስተበቊዐክሙ፡ አኀዊነ፡ ገሥጽዎሙ፡ ለዝሉፋን፡ ናዝዝዎሙ፡ ለሕዙናን። ጹርዎሙ፡ ለድኩማን፡ ወተዐገሡ፡ ላዕለ፡ ኵሉ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 17,
          "unit_order": 17,
          "source_marker": "15",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=15"
          ],
          "text": "ዑቁ፡ ኢትግበሩ፡ እኩየ፡ ህየንተ፡ እኪት። አላ፡ ተባደሩ፡ ዘልፈ፡ ለሠናይ፡ በበይናቲክሙ፡ ወለኵሉሂ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 18,
          "unit_order": 18,
          "source_marker": null,
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [],
          "text": "ዘከመ፡ ይደሉ፡ ጸልዮ፡ ለአኀው"
        },
        {
          "number": 19,
          "unit_order": 19,
          "source_marker": "16",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=16"
          ],
          "text": "ተፈሥሑ፡ በኵሉ፡ ጊዜ፡ ወጸልዩ፡ ወትረ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 20,
          "unit_order": 20,
          "source_marker": "17",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=17"
          ],
          "text": "አእኵትዎ፡ ለእግዚአብሔር፡ አብ፡ በእንተ፡ ኵሉ፡ ግብር።"
        },
        {
          "number": 21,
          "unit_order": 21,
          "source_marker": "18",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=18"
          ],
          "text": "እስመ፡ ዝ፡ ውእቱ፡ ፈቃዱ፡ ለእግዚአብሔር፡ እምውስቴትክሙ፡ በኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 22,
          "unit_order": 22,
          "source_marker": "19",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=19"
          ],
          "text": "መንፈሰ፡ ኢታጥፍኡ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 23,
          "unit_order": 23,
          "source_marker": "20",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=20"
          ],
          "text": "ወተነብዮ፡ ኢትመንኑ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 24,
          "unit_order": 24,
          "source_marker": "21",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=21"
          ],
          "text": "ወኵሎ፡ አመክሩ፡ ወዘሠናይ፡ አጽንዑ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 25,
          "unit_order": 25,
          "source_marker": "22",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=22"
          ],
          "text": "ወተገሐሡ፡ እምኵሉ፡ ምግባር፡ እኩይ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 26,
          "unit_order": 26,
          "source_marker": "23",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=23"
          ],
          "text": "ወእግዚአብሔር፡ አምላከ፡ ሰላም፡ ይቀድስክሙ፡ ፍጹመ። ወያጥዒክሙ፡ ነፍሰክሙ፡ ወመንፈሰክሙ፡ ወሥጋክሙ፡ በንጽሕ። እስከ፡ ምጽአተ፡ እግዚእነ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 27,
          "unit_order": 27,
          "source_marker": "24",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=24"
          ],
          "text": "ወዘጸውዐክሙ፡ ጻድቅ፡ ውእቱ፡ ይግበር፡ ለክሙ፡ ዘንተ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 28,
          "unit_order": 28,
          "source_marker": "25",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=25"
          ],
          "text": "ኦ፡ አኀዊነ፡ ጸልዩ፡ ለነ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 29,
          "unit_order": 29,
          "source_marker": "26",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=26"
          ],
          "text": "አምኁ፡ ኵሎ፡ አኀዊነ፡ በአምኃ፡ ቅድሳት፡ ወተአምኁ፡ በበይናቲክሙ።"
        },
        {
          "number": 30,
          "unit_order": 30,
          "source_marker": "27",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=27"
          ],
          "text": "አምሕለክሙ፡ በእግዚእነ፡ ታንብብዋ፡ ለዛቲ፡ መጽሐፍ፡ ላዕለ፡ ኵሎሙ፡ አኀዊነ፡ ቅዱሳን።"
        },
        {
          "number": 31,
          "unit_order": 31,
          "source_marker": "28",
          "source_element_id": null,
          "source_refs": [
            "http://classic.net.bible.org/verse.php?book=1Th&chapter=5&verse=28"
          ],
          "text": "ጸጋሁ፡ ለእግዚእነ፡ ኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ ምስሌክሙ፡ አሜን።"
        }
      ],
      "notes": []
    }
  ]
}
